+# (tasks/briefs/system1/vscrub2r3/vscrub2r1r3_red.py), their bodies and assertions as it wrote them, on this file's module
+# (MOD), _canon, _hidden and token_hex. A head the PIN never read took a value that ran over the head of a rule that runs
+# after it in scrub_payload (the R1 escaped-quote credential, the PASS rule, curl's `-u`), and that rule's value showed in
